# Essay voice

- First-person, conversational, and direct.
- Prefer natural sentences, commas, and periods.
- Avoid em dashes and excessive hyphenation.
- Do not sound overly polished or AI-generated.
- Preserve personality; do not polish it away.
- Ground claims in real scenes and named costs.
